OL,3,AUS Marine arrested over murder of woman
OL,4,Ain Okinawa, Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA US Marine has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a woman's
OL,8,Fbody was found in a hotel in Okinawa,
OL,9,FJapan, local officials say.
OL,11,FJapanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi
OL,12,Fdescribed the crime as a "brutal and
OL,13,Fheinous" robbery and murder. She said
OL,14,Fshe had urged the US to "enforce
OL,15,Fstricter discipline" of its personnel.
OL,17,FJapan's public broadcaster NHK
OL,18,Fidentified the victim as Yagi Anna, 39,
OL,19,Fand the suspect as Devin Jacob Ballard,
OL,20,F20, who is stationed at US Marine Corps
OL,21,FAir Station Futenma.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
