OL,3,AUS Marine arrested over murder of woman
OL,4,Ain Okinawa, Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are actively cooperating with
OL,7,FJapanese authorities, in response to
OL,8,Fallegations of serious criminal actions
OL,9,Fby a Marine," the Marine Corps said on
OL,10,Fsocial media, extending condolences to
OL,11,Fthe victim's family.
